NOTE ON LOGISIM EVOLUTION ITSELF

This package contains NO Logisim code and distributes NO Logisim binary. It drives a Logisim Evolution
jar that the user installs separately (see docs/installation.md). Logisim Evolution is a separate work
released under the GNU General Public License v3; that licence governs Logisim, not this package.

The component knowledge base in references/ was MEASURED from a Logisim Evolution build and its source,
and records facts - component names, attribute names, port coordinates, behaviour. Facts are not
copyrightable, and the source citations point at the upstream repository rather than reproducing it.
